wazaif.transliteration:
Bismillahir Rahmanir Raheem.
Kafaka Rabbuka kam yakfeeka wakifatan; kafkafuha kakameenin kana min kalakin;
Takurru karran kakarri al-karri fee kabidin tahkee mushakshakatan kallak laka al-kalaka;
Kafaka ma bee kafaka al-kaafu kurbatahu; ya kawkaban kana yahkee kawkaba al-falak.
